{"seq":2,"slug":"adt-records","title":"代数数据类型与记录：把数据的形状说清楚","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/grain-language/language/adt-records","wordCount":1016,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"代数数据类型与记录-把数据的形状说清楚\">代数数据类型与记录：把数据的形状说清楚</h1><p>大多数 bug 的根源不是逻辑写错，而是数据处于本不该存在的状态：一个&quot;要么有值要么出错&quot;的返回被塞进了 <code>null</code>，一个&quot;三选一&quot;的状态被用三个布尔位表示、于是有了本不合法的第四种组合。Grain 的对策是让类型系统精确刻画数据的形状——用 <code>enum</code> 表达&quot;多选一&quot;，用 <code>record</code> 表达&quot;多者皆有&quot;，让非法状态在类型层面根本无法表达（<a href=\"https://grain-lang.org/docs/\">grain-lang.org/docs</a>）。这两块拼图合称代数数据类型（ADT）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-和类型与积类型\">核心概念：和类型与积类型</h2><p>&quot;代数&quot;二字来自两种组合数据的方式，恰好对应加法与乘法。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[代数数据类型] --&gt; B[和类型 sum: enum]&#10;    A --&gt; C[积类型 product: record / tuple]&#10;    B --&gt; D[值是若干变体之一&lt;br/&gt;取值数 = 各变体之和]&#10;    C --&gt; E[值同时含多个字段&lt;br/&gt;取值数 = 各字段之积]&#10;    D --&gt; F[enum Shape 是 Circle 或 Rect 之一]&#10;    E --&gt; G[record Point 同时有 x 和 y]\">graph TD\n    A[代数数据类型] --&gt; B[和类型 sum: enum]\n    A --&gt; C[积类型 product: record / tuple]\n    B --&gt; D[值是若干变体之一&lt;br/&gt;取值数 = 各变体之和]\n    C --&gt; E[值同时含多个字段&lt;br/&gt;取值数 = 各字段之积]\n    D --&gt; F[enum Shape 是 Circle 或 Rect 之一]\n    E --&gt; G[record Point 同时有 x 和 y]</pre><p>若类型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 的可能取值个数记为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|T|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>，那么和类型满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|A + B| = |A| + |B|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>，积类型满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|A \\times B| = |A| \\times |B|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>。这不是文字游戏——它精确解释了为什么一个&quot;三选一状态&quot;该用有三个变体的 <code>enum</code>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 种取值）而不是三个布尔（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^3 = 8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 种，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 种非法）。代数类型的通用理论见 <a href=\"../../functional-programming/algebraic-types/sum-and-product-types\">函数式编程：和类型与积类型</a>，本篇讲它们在 Grain 里的具体语法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"enum-带泛型构造子的和类型\">enum：带泛型构造子的和类型</h2><p>Grain 的 <code>enum</code> 定义一组互斥的变体，每个变体（构造子）可以携带数据，还可以带泛型参数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"grain\" data-code=\"enum Veggie { Squash, Cabbage, Broccoli }&#10;&#10;enum Inventory&lt;produce&gt; {&#10;  Empty,&#10;  Crate(produce),&#10;  Truckload(produce, Number),&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>enum Veggie { Squash, Cabbage, Broccoli }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>enum Inventory&#x3C;produce> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Empty,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Crate(produce),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Truckload(produce, Number),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>Veggie</code> 是最简单的枚举，三个无载荷变体。<code>Inventory&lt;produce&gt;</code> 则是泛型和类型：<code>Crate</code> 装一个 <code>produce</code>，<code>Truckload</code> 装一个 <code>produce</code> 加一个数量。构造一个值就是调用构造子：<code>Truckload(Squash, 200)</code>。因为类型是泛型的，同一份 <code>Inventory</code> 定义能装蔬菜、装水果、装任何东西，类型由 <a href=\"types-inference\">类型推断</a> 自动填上。</p>\n<p>和类型最有价值的用途是让状态精确。比如一个网络请求的状态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"grain\" data-code=\"enum RequestState&lt;data&gt; {&#10;  Idle,&#10;  Loading,&#10;  Success(data),&#10;  Failure(String),&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>enum RequestState&#x3C;data> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Idle,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Loading,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Success(data),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Failure(String),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这四个变体覆盖且仅覆盖所有合法状态——不可能出现&quot;既 Loading 又 Success&quot;或&quot;Success 却没有 data&quot;的非法组合。这正是 ADT 消除 bug 的方式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"record-命名字段的积类型\">record：命名字段的积类型</h2><p>当数据是&quot;多者皆有&quot;而非&quot;多选一&quot;，用 <code>record</code>。它类似其它语言的结构体，但字段有名字、类型被检查：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"grain\" data-code=\"record Farmer {&#10;  name: String,&#10;  age: Number,&#10;  mut crops: Number,&#10;}&#10;&#10;let alice = { name: &quot;Alice&quot;, age: 42, crops: 3 }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>record Farmer {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  age: Number,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  mut crops: Number,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let alice = { name: \"Alice\", age: 42, crops: 3 }</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>mut</code> 关键字标记可变字段——Grain 虽是函数式语言，但务实地允许受控可变。访问用点号 <code>alice.name</code>，更新可变字段用 <code>alice.crops = 4</code>。记录也可泛型化，字段类型同样由推断补全。</p>\n<p>下表把两种 ADT 的用途对照清楚：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>enum（和类型）</th>\n<th>record（积类型）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>语义</td>\n<td>值是多个变体之一</td>\n<td>值同时含多个字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>取值数</td>\n<td>各变体之和</td>\n<td>各字段之积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型用途</td>\n<td>状态机、结果、可选值</td>\n<td>实体、配置、坐标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消费方式</td>\n<td>模式匹配（见下）</td>\n<td>字段访问 / 解构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可变性</td>\n<td>变体不可变</td>\n<td>字段可标 <code>mut</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"内建的-option-与-result\">内建的 Option 与 Result</h2><p>Grain 标准库把两种最常用的和类型内建好了，你几乎每天都会用到：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"grain\" data-code=\"// 标准库中概念上等价的定义&#10;enum Option&lt;a&gt; { None, Some(a) }&#10;enum Result&lt;ok, err&gt; { Ok(ok), Err(err) }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 标准库中概念上等价的定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>enum Option&#x3C;a> { None, Some(a) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>enum Result&#x3C;ok, err> { Ok(ok), Err(err) }</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>Option&lt;a&gt;</code> 表达&quot;可能没有值&quot;，取代其它语言里危险的 <code>null</code>；<code>Result&lt;ok, err&gt;</code> 表达&quot;可能失败并带错误信息&quot;。它们把&quot;值缺失&quot;和&quot;操作失败&quot;从运行时炸弹变成类型里的显式变体——编译器会逼你处理 <code>None</code> 和 <code>Err</code> 分支。而&quot;逼你处理所有分支&quot;的机制，就是下一篇 <a href=\"pattern-matching\">模式匹配</a> 的穷尽性检查。ADT 定义数据、模式匹配消费数据，两者是一枚硬币的两面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>代数数据类型 = 和类型（<code>enum</code>）+ 积类型（<code>record</code>/元组），对应取值数的加法与乘法。</li>\n<li><code>enum</code> 定义互斥变体，构造子可带载荷、可泛型，用来让状态精确、非法状态不可表达。</li>\n<li><code>record</code> 定义命名字段的结构，字段可标 <code>mut</code> 支持受控可变。</li>\n<li>内建 <code>Option</code>/<code>Result</code> 用和类型消灭 <code>null</code> 与隐式异常。</li>\n<li>ADT 定义数据形状，模式匹配消费它——两篇必须连起来读。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：<a href=\"pattern-matching\">模式匹配</a>——如何解构并穷尽处理这里定义的数据；<a href=\"types-inference\">类型与推断</a>——泛型构造子的类型如何被自动填上。</li>\n<li>通用理论：<a href=\"../../functional-programming/algebraic-types/sum-and-product-types\">函数式编程：和类型与积类型</a>；<a href=\"../../functional-programming/algebraic-types/option-and-result\">函数式编程：Option 与 Result</a>。</li>\n<li>对照实现：<a href=\"../../rust-language/type-system/enums-and-pattern-matching\">Rust：枚举与模式匹配</a>——另一门语言里同款 ADT 的形态。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"代数数据类型与记录：把数据的形状说清楚","id":"代数数据类型与记录-把数据的形状说清楚"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：和类型与积类型","id":"核心概念-和类型与积类型"},{"level":2,"text":"enum：带泛型构造子的和类型","id":"enum-带泛型构造子的和类型"},{"level":2,"text":"record：命名字段的积类型","id":"record-命名字段的积类型"},{"level":2,"text":"内建的 Option 与 Result","id":"内建的-option-与-result"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"类型与推断：从 OCaml 借来的 Hindley-Milner","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/grain-language/language/types-inference"},"next":{"title":"模式匹配：让编译器替你堵住每一个分支","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/grain-language/language/pattern-matching"}}